{"id":"H1787","lemma":"דִּישֹׁן","transliteration":"dishon","sayIt":"di-shon","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Dishon","meaning":"A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.36.21;\nson of: Seir (H8165B);\nbrother of: Lotan (H3877), Shobal (H7732), Zibeon (H6649H), Anah (H6034H), Ezer (H0687), Dishan (H1789) and Timna (H8555H);\nfather of: Hemdan (H2533), Eshban (H0790), Ithran (H3506), Cheran (H3763)\nAlso named: di.shan (דִּישָׁן \"Dishon\" H1789H)\n§ Dishon = \"thresher\"\n1) the fifth son of Seir\n2) the son of Anah and grandson of Seir","glosses":["dishon","dishan"],"count":6,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"Dishon","kjv":"And Dishon"}},{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"Dishon","kjv":"Dishon"}},{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":30,"renderings":{"bsb":"Dishon","kjv":"Dishon"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":38,"renderings":{"bsb":"Dishon","kjv":"and Dishon"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":41,"renderings":{"bsb":"Dishon","kjv":"Dishon"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":42,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Dishan"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 36:21","note":"Dishon, Ezer, and Dishan. These are the chiefs who came of the Horites, the children of Seir in the land of Edom.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 1:38","note":"The sons of Seir: Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah, Dishon, Ezer, and Dishan.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H1789","lemma":"דִּישָׁן","transliteration":"dishan","gloss":"Dishan"},{"id":"H6034","lemma":"עֲנָה","transliteration":"anah","gloss":"Anah"},{"id":"H0687","lemma":"אֵ֫צֶר","transliteration":"etser","gloss":"Ezer"},{"id":"H8165","lemma":"שֵׂעִיר","transliteration":"seir","gloss":"Seir"},{"id":"H3877","lemma":"לוֹטָן","transliteration":"lotan","gloss":"Lotan"},{"id":"H7732","lemma":"שׁוֹבָל","transliteration":"shoval","gloss":"Shobal"},{"id":"H6649","lemma":"צִבְעוֹן","transliteration":"tsivon","gloss":"Zibeon"},{"id":"H8555","lemma":"תִּמְנָע","transliteration":"timna","gloss":"Timna"}],"se